                                "sense_id": "c83acb9f-4d37-344b-b9f6-22f9e1b31fcc",
                                "text": "If he kicks me out, so be it. I’m happy. Come on, though, if Barefoot Contessa kicked me out — psh! I mean, I love her, but come on."
                            },
